id: H05
target: src/sello/private/sha512.nim
desc: compress: FIPS 180-4 Sec 4.1.3 BigSigma1(e) = ROTR(e,14) xor ROTR(e,18) xor ROTR(e,41) rotation-amount off-by-one, first rotate '14' -> '13', 'let bigS1 = rotr64(v[4], 14) xor rotr64(v[4], 18) xor rotr64(v[4], 41)' -> '... rotr64(v[4], 13) ...'. One of the RFC-006 slice 4 list's named Sigma/sigma rotation-amount off-by-one mutants (the round-function BigSigma1, as distinct from the message-schedule sigma functions H06/H07 target).
====OLD====
    let bigS1 = rotr64(v[4], 14) xor rotr64(v[4], 18) xor rotr64(v[4], 41)
====NEW====
    let bigS1 = rotr64(v[4], 13) xor rotr64(v[4], 18) xor rotr64(v[4], 41)
====END====
